type\":\"message\"}\n{\"message\":{\"blocks\":[{\"is_error\":true,\"output\":\"missing field `pattern`\",\"tool_name\":\"glob_search\",\"tool_use_id\":\"functions.glob_search:50\",\"type\":\"tool_result\"}],\"role\":\"tool\"},\"type\":\"message\"}\n{\"message\":{\"blocks\":[{\"text\":\"Here's a broad survey of what Weights & Biases offers, mapped against what your autopipe dashboard already has and what's missing:\\n\\n## W&B Features vs. Your autopipe Dashboard\\n\\n| Feature | W&B | Your autopipe Status | Gap |\\n|---------|-----|------------------------|-----|\\n| **Runs Table** | Sortable, filterable, groupable, column-configurable, tag editor, color-by-metric | Basic table with search + status filter | Configurable columns, grouping, tags, color-by |\\n| **Run Comparison** | Side-by-side params, metric deltas, parallel coords, scatter matrix, diff viewer | `RunCompare.tsx` with params + metrics + diffs | Parallel coordinates, scatter matrix, config diff, trend overlays |\\n| **Workspace / Charts** | Panels: line, scatter, bar, histogram, parallel coordinates, confusion matrix, media grid, custom queries | ❌ Not started | Panel system, chart library integration, metric time-series |\\n| **Sweeps** | Bayesian, random, grid search with run orchestration | `POST /experiments/{id}/trials` generates trial configs | Sweep agent, visualization of search space, hyperparam importance |\\n| **Artifacts** | Model files, datasets, code snapshots with lineage graph | `Artifact` table exists, no UI | Artifact browser, lineage visualization, storage backend |\\n| **Media Logging** | Images, audio, video, 3D, tables logged per step and browsable | ❌ Not started | File storage, serving, media gallery UI |\\n| **System Metrics** | GPU / CPU / memory / disk / network per step | ❌ Not started | Metrics collector, system metrics model, charts |\\n| **Reports** | Markdown docs embedding panels, runs, code | ❌ Not started | Report CRUD, markdown editor, panel embedding |\\n| **WebSocket Streaming** | Real-time metric curves and logs as runs execute | WS channels exist but streaming metrics not wired | Stream metric deltas and logs from executor to frontend charts |\\n| **Alerts & Drift** | Alert rules on metrics, drift detection, notifications | `DriftReport` + `Alerts` models exist | Alert creation UI, notification bell, alert history page |\\n| **Tags & Notes** | Per-run tags, notes, descriptions | No tags/notes fields | Add to model/schema/UI |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## What I'd Recommend Building Next\\n\\nRanked by impact for an ML experiment tracker:\\n\\n### 1. **Metric Time-Series + Workspace Charts** (highest impact)\\nThe single most important missing piece. W&B's workspace is what makes it indispensable — you create panels that plot metrics (loss, accuracy, etc.) over steps, with line charts, scatter plots, and histograms.\\n\\n**What to build:**\\n- A `MetricLog` model: `{run_id, metric_name, step, value, timestamp}` (append-only time-series)\\n- Executor pushes metric logs during step execution\\n- Workspace page with configurable chart panels (Recharts or ECharts)\\n- Panel types: **Line Chart**, **Scatter**, **Bar Chart**, **Parallel Coordinates**\\n- Save workspace layout to DB\\n\\n### 2. **Runs Table Enhancement** (quick wins)\\n- Column visibility toggle (show/hide config keys and metric keys as columns)\\n- Group runs by config key (e.g., group by `learning_rate` to see averages)\\n- Tag editing inline (add/remove tags on runs)\\n- Color rows by a metric value (heatmap on accuracy column)\\n- Export table to CSV\\n\\n### 3. **Artifact Browser** (medium lift, high value)\\nYour backend already has an `Artifact` model. Build a tree-view UI for browsing artifacts per run, with download links and lineage (which run produced which model file).\\n\\n### 4. **Real-time Metric Streaming** (nice-to-have)\\nInstead of polling, stream metric values via the existing WebSocket so charts update live as a run is executing.\\n\\n---\\n\\nWhich direction do you want to go? I'd suggest starting with **#1 (Workspace Charts)** since it's the biggest gap vs. W&B, or **#2 (Runs Table enhancements)** if you want quicker visible improvements.\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"role\":\"assistant\",\"usage\":{\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":0,\"input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":0}},\"type\":\"message\"}\n{\"text\":\"now  create a comprehensive plan first using the guidelines i have provided and start coding it, you have a clear goal now.\",\"timestamp_ms\":1776754713914,\"type\":\"prompt_history\"}\n{\"message\":{\"blocks\":[{\"text\":\"now  create a comprehensive plan first using the guidelines i have provided and start coding it, you have a clear goal now.\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"role\":\"user\"},\"type\":\"message\"}\n{\"message\":{\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"functions.glob_search:51\",\"input\":\"{\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"**/dashboard/backend/app/db/models.py\\\"}\",\"name\":\"glob_search\",\"type\":\"tool_use\"}],\"role\":\"assistant\",\"usage\":{\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":0,\"input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":0}},\"type\":\"message\"}\n{\"message\":{\"blocks\":[{\"is_error\":false,\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"durationMs\\\": 1844,\\n  \\\"numFiles\\\": 1,\\n  \\\"filenames\\\": [\\n    \\\"/Users/philosopher/active/autopipe/autopipe/dashboard/backend/app/db/models.py\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"truncated\\\": false\\n}\",\"tool_name\":\"glob_search\",\"tool_use_id\":\"functions.glob_search:51\",\"type\":\"tool_result\"}],\"role\":\"tool\"},\"type\":\"message\"}\n{\"message\":{\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"functions.glob_search:53\",\"input\":\"{\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"dashboard/frontend/src/pages/**/*Chart*\\\"}\",\"name\":\"glob_search\",\"type\":\"tool_use\"}],\"role\":\"assistant\",\"usage\":{\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":0,\"input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":0}},\"type\":\"message\"}\n{\"message\":{\"blocks\":[{\"is_error\":false,\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"duratio